sequenceDiagram
    participant DP as Data Principal<br/>(S.2(j))
    participant W as Web App<br/>[Purpose: loan_origination]
    participant CM as Consent Service<br/>(S.6(10) ledger)
    participant KYC as KYC Processor<br/>(S.8(1) DPA-bound)
    participant DB as Customer DB<br/>[Rule 6(1)(a) encrypted]
    participant DPB as Data Protection Board

    DP->>W: Submit loan application (PII)
    W->>CM: Record consent [purpose=loan_origination, lang=ta]
    CM-->>W: consent_id (signed, timestamped)
    W->>KYC: Forward KYC docs (TLS 1.3, mTLS)
    KYC-->>W: KYC verdict
    W->>DB: Store application (field-level encrypted)
    Note over DB: Retention clock: erase when purpose served (S.8(7)), logs kept min 1y (Rule 8(3))
    DP->>W: Section 12 erasure request
    W->>CM: Revoke consent + cascade delete
    CM->>DB: Cryptographic erasure (key destruction)
    W-->>DP: Confirmation (Rule 6(1)(c) logged)
    Note over W,DPB: On breach: Rule 7 — DPs and Board without delay<br/>detailed Board report within 72h (Rule 7(2)(b))
